WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.638
The broadcast tower was about to crush people in the street below.

2
00:00:04.639 --> 00:00:08.752
Roxy flew fast and caught the tower.

3
00:00:08.753 --> 00:00:11.090
"Oh boy!" she said.

4
00:00:11.091 --> 00:00:13.748
"This thing is hard to carry.

5
00:00:13.749 --> 00:00:16.305
I have to put it down somewhere."

6
00:00:16.306 --> 00:00:18.050
Roxy looked down.

7
00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:20.732
Cars and people filled the streets.

8
00:00:20.733 --> 00:00:22.496
There was only one thing to do.

9
00:00:22.497 --> 00:00:25.072
She had to put the tower back on the roof.

10
00:00:25.073 --> 00:00:27.270
Roxy flew up with the tower.

11
00:00:27.271 --> 00:00:31.795
Groaning, she managed to set it back on its base.

12
00:00:31.796 --> 00:00:34.985
"Phew!" Roxy thought. "I did it.

13
00:00:34.986 --> 00:00:37.686
But Darklight Man cut the metal beams.

14
00:00:37.687 --> 00:00:41.179
Now I have to attach the tower back to the base."

15
00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:45.725
Whiz-hoo! She shot her eye laser beams on the bottom of the tower.

16
00:00:45.726 --> 00:00:49.843
The metal parts fused together.

17
00:00:49.844 --> 00:00:53.568
"Yes!" Roxy said, wiping sweat from her forehead.

18
00:00:53.569 --> 00:00:56.053
She looked around for Darklight Man.

19
00:00:56.054 --> 00:00:58.065
But the villain had disappeared.

20
00:00:58.066 --> 00:00:59.955
Just then she heard her name.

21
00:00:59.956 --> 00:01:04.639
"Rocket Girl!" a voice boomed.

22
00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:06.464
Roxy looked down.

23
00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:10.102
Detective Smith was standing on the sidewalk, holding a megaphone.

24
00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:13.194
"Please come down here immediately."

25
00:01:13.195 --> 00:01:17.022
Roxy flew down. "What's up, Detective Smith?"

26
00:01:17.023 --> 00:01:21.591
"Something awful." Detective Smith groaned.

27
00:01:21.592 --> 00:01:23.998
"Darklight Man captured Mighty Man!

28
00:01:23.999 --> 00:01:27.497
He said he was going to parade Mighty Man all around Metro City.

29
00:01:27.498 --> 00:01:32.073
Then everyone will know that Darklight Man is a supervillain." Roxy

30
00:01:32.074 --> 00:01:34.238
stamped her foot. "This

31
00:01:34.239 --> 00:01:36.692
guy is getting me mad. Don't

32
00:01:36.693 --> 00:01:39.960
worry. I'll find Mighty Man." She

33
00:01:39.961 --> 00:01:42.967
took off and flew over the city. She

34
00:01:42.968 --> 00:01:47.628
soon spotted Darklight Man leading Mighty Man along a street. The

35
00:01:47.629 --> 00:01:52.230
actor's hands were tied, and he looked terrified. A

36
00:01:52.231 --> 00:01:54.991
group of people was watching the scene. "Cool!

37
00:01:54.992 --> 00:01:59.516
They're filming an episode of Mighty Man !" a kid said.

38
00:01:59.517 --> 00:02:01.480
A woman eating peanuts grinned.

39
00:02:01.481 --> 00:02:05.217
"It looks like Mighty Man is in real trouble this time.

40
00:02:05.218 --> 00:02:08.078
How will he get out of this one?"

41
00:02:08.079 --> 00:02:10.915
"Help!" the Mighty Man actor yelled.

42
00:02:10.916 --> 00:02:14.630
"This isn't a Mighty Man episode! It's real life.

43
00:02:14.631 --> 00:02:17.546
And I'm not a real superhero!"

44
00:02:17.547 --> 00:02:21.049
Roxy landed.

45
00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:24.490
"Rocket Girl!" the kid said excitedly.

46
00:02:24.491 --> 00:02:26.921
But Darklight Man looked furious.

47
00:02:26.922 --> 00:02:31.016
"Don't even think about using your powers, Rocket Girl! Or . . ."

48
00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:33.850
He put his light blade right below Mighty Man's chin.

49
00:02:33.851 --> 00:02:36.793
"It will be lights out for Mighty Man!"

50
00:02:36.794 --> 00:02:39.368
The actor whimpered.

51
00:02:39.369 --> 00:02:42.391
"Do something, Rocket Girl!" the kid said.

52
00:02:42.392 --> 00:02:44.973
"Mighty Man needs you!"

53
00:02:44.974 --> 00:02:46.667
Everyone was looking at her.

54
00:02:46.668 --> 00:02:48.224
Roxy bit her lip.

55
00:02:48.225 --> 00:02:51.829
"Mighty Man isn't a real superhero," she thought.

56
00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:56.961
"But I am—and I don't know what to do!"

